    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/cadf07cb5f9fcc368a56dd14974a996e.poster.avif?t=1754837190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/cadf07cb5f9fcc368a56dd14974a996e.webm?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/cadf07cb5f9fcc368a56dd14974a996e.mp4?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an operator in a retro-futuristic dystopia, where a screen displays the world under constant surveillance. With moral dilemmas similar to <strong>Papers, Please</strong> and subtle hints of <strong>Pony Island\u2019s</strong> unsettling atmosphere, <strong>Monitor State</strong> puts you in control of a surveillance system, watching citizens, enforcing laws, and uncovering a web of secrets that could change everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/763b82ea2456bc2890a5ac0c7e489c7e.poster.avif?t=1754837190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/763b82ea2456bc2890a5ac0c7e489c7e.webm?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/763b82ea2456bc2890a5ac0c7e489c7e.mp4?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing World</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gripping Storyline</strong>: Dive into a detailed dystopian world where each case reveals hidden stories, drawing you into a thrilling plot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Incidents</strong>: From street clashes to suspicious behavior, the system logs every event, demanding your attention and decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Laws</strong>: Rules shift with the times, challenging you to adapt your approach to each case. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Your Choices</strong>: Every decision leaves subtle traces, hinting at consequences that could reshape the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Burden, Your Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dossiers reveal names, histories, and secrets, leaving you to decide: arrest, fine, or ignore violations. Each choice carries weight, watched closely by a distant department that scrutinizes your every move. The system evolves, and so must you, navigating a web of consequences in a world where right and wrong blur into shades of gray. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Connected</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor State</strong> is a work in progress. Add it to your wishlist to get notified about the release and join our <strong>Discord</strong>\u00a0for updates!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/cadf07cb5f9fcc368a56dd14974a996e.poster.avif?t=1754837190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/cadf07cb5f9fcc368a56dd14974a996e.webm?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/cadf07cb5f9fcc368a56dd14974a996e.mp4?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an operator in a retro-futuristic dystopia, where a screen displays the world under constant surveillance. With moral dilemmas similar to <strong>Papers, Please</strong> and subtle hints of <strong>Pony Island\u2019s</strong> unsettling atmosphere, <strong>Monitor State</strong> puts you in control of a surveillance system, watching citizens, enforcing laws, and uncovering a web of secrets that could change everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/763b82ea2456bc2890a5ac0c7e489c7e.poster.avif?t=1754837190\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/763b82ea2456bc2890a5ac0c7e489c7e.webm?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612630/extras/763b82ea2456bc2890a5ac0c7e489c7e.mp4?t=1754837190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing World</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gripping Storyline</strong>: Dive into a detailed dystopian world where each case reveals hidden stories, drawing you into a thrilling plot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Incidents</strong>: From street clashes to suspicious behavior, the system logs every event, demanding your attention and decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Laws</strong>: Rules shift with the times, challenging you to adapt your approach to each case. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Your Choices</strong>: Every decision leaves subtle traces, hinting at consequences that could reshape the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Burden, Your Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dossiers reveal names, histories, and secrets, leaving you to decide: arrest, fine, or ignore violations. Each choice carries weight, watched closely by a distant department that scrutinizes your every move. The system evolves, and so must you, navigating a web of consequences in a world where right and wrong blur into shades of gray. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Connected</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor State</strong> is a work in progress. Add it to your wishlist to get notified about the release and join our <strong>Discord</strong>\u00a0for updates!\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "You are an operator in a dystopia, watch and punish citizens in a retro-futuristic world. Experience a gripping storyline with moral dilemmas. Obey, resist, or find another path.",
